      "line": "what the price implies",
      "label": "CALCULATION",
      "text": "At ₹3,487 (NSE close, 23 Nov 2026), the reinvestment-phase discounted cash flow model (Template B, since M&M's median return on invested capital of 13.0% is above its 12.11% cost of capital) matches the price if revenue grows about 54.7% a year for five years at the FY26 operating margin of 14.9%; M&M's revenue grew 17.9% a year over FY23–FY26.",
